(This chapter presents the methodology adopted in designing and developing the Abia State University \(ABSU\) Staff) Tj
T* (Database Management Portal. It provides a detailed exposition of the software development lifecycle, system) Tj
T* (analysis, functional and non-functional requirements, system architecture, database design, and the technical) Tj
T* (toolchain utilized during implementation. The objective is to provide a structured, replicable technical blueprint) Tj
T* (explaining how the web portal was conceived, architected, developed, and verified.) Tj
ET
