/F1 10 Tf
11.5 TL
0.278 0.333 0.412 rg
40. 625.8899999999999864 Td
(The development of this project followed the Agile Development Methodology \(Iterative and Prototyping Model\). Staff) Tj
T* (records management involves diverse stakeholder roles \(Super Administrators, Administrators, and) Tj
T* (Academic/Non-Academic Staff\). An iterative approach allowed continuous verification, requirement refinement, and) Tj
T* (agile feature delivery.) Tj
ET
BT
/F2 11 Tf
12.6499999999999986 TL
0.2 0.255 0.333 rg
40. 561.8899999999999864 Td
(3.2.1 Justification for Agile / Prototyping) Tj
ET
