/F2 10 Tf
11.5 TL
0.2 0.255 0.333 rg
50. 545.8899999999999864 Td
(• Iterative Feedback: Stakeholder requirements evolved during development—such as adding dual Super) Tj
T* (Admin rights, live multi-format report exports \(PDF and Excel\), and client-side photograph compression.) Tj
ET
BT
/F2 10 Tf
11.5 TL
0.2 0.255 0.333 rg
50. 511.8899999999999864 Td
(• Speed & Responsiveness: State transitions \(e.g. from 'Submitted' to 'Approved' or 'Rejected'\) were) Tj
T* (incrementally implemented, tested, and validated without discarding previous progress.) Tj
ET
BT
/F2 10 Tf
11.5 TL
0.2 0.255 0.333 rg
50. 477.8899999999999864 Td
(• Risk Reduction: Continuous integration and unit compilation in a modern sandbox environment) Tj
T* (ensured that potential dependency conflicts or Firebase permission errors were caught and resolved) Tj
T* (early.) Tj
ET
