(• Role-Based Access Control \(RBAC\): Hierarchical privileges separating Super Administrators \(sole) Tj
T* (authority to grant or revoke administrative roles\), Administrators \(verifying submissions, manual staff) Tj
T* (entry, CSV bulk uploads, deletions, announcements\), and Staff Users \(self-service profile entry and) Tj
T* (updates\).) Tj
ET
