(When a staff member registers or updates their credentials, the record is flagged with a 'Submitted' status.) Tj
T* (Administrators review the entry within their dashboard, inspecting photographic and departmental data. The) Tj
T* (administrator can click 'Accept' \(setting status to 'Approved'\) or 'Reject' \(setting status to 'Rejected'\). Real-time) Tj
T* (Firestore snapshot listeners immediately reflect this state change on the user's interface.) Tj
