(This chapter presented the comprehensive methodology, architectural specifications, and database schema) Tj
T* (governing the ABSU Staff Database Management Portal. By integrating an Agile prototyping methodology with) Tj
T* (modern web technologies \(React, TypeScript, Tailwind CSS\) and Google Cloud Firestore services, the system) Tj
T* (delivers real-time synchronization, multi-tiered governance, client-side report exports, and efficient client-side asset) Tj
T* (optimization.) Tj
